  "description": "Do Se-Na, a city dweller tormented by unemployment, runs up the mountain behind her house out of frustration and encounters Baek Du-Gang, a man of nature. So, men of nature really exist. And right on the mountain behind my house, no less. Seeing him, who resembles a wild beast, Se-Na vows never to climb the mountain again. Barely managing to return home and resume her daily life, Se-Na spots a familiar face. It is none other than that person from back then…\n\nWait, wasn't he a 'man of nature'? I get it, just stop pretending to know me. Please!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
